      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Base Struct Getter",
          "type": "FBaseStructGetter&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "The input parameter is a function that fetches the UStruct representing the base class for all the stored structs.\nWe're unable to get the UStruct parameter directly since FStructTracker instances are being created during\nmodule loading (via DEFINE_TYPEBITSET macro), and the ::StaticStruct call fails at that point for types defined\nin the same module."
    },
